CHAIRPERSON'S SCRIPT — {{ event.name }}
(One copy per room. The chairperson reads the parts in plain text; fill in the blanks.)

{% for r in rounds %}
ROUND {{ r.number }}
Good {{ time_of_day }}, adjudicator, speakers and audience, and welcome to round {{ r.number }} of the {{ event.name }}.
{% if r.motion %}The motion for this debate is: "{{ r.motion }}".{% else %}The motion for this debate is: "______________________".{% endif %}

The affirmative team is: ______________________ (1st speaker __________, 2nd speaker __________, 3rd speaker __________).
The negative team is: ______________________ (1st speaker __________, 2nd speaker __________, 3rd speaker __________).
Our adjudicator is __________ and our timekeeper is __________.

Each speaker has {{ (format.speech_seconds // 60) if format.speech_seconds else "__" }} minutes. There will be one knock at one minute to go and two knocks when time is up.
{% if format.reply %}Reply speeches are {{ (format.reply_seconds // 60) if format.reply_seconds else "__" }} minutes, given by the first or second speaker; the negative replies first.{% endif %}

I now call on the first speaker of the affirmative team to open the debate.
(After each speech:) Thank you. I now call on the ______ speaker of the ______ team.
(After the last speech:) Thank you. That concludes the debate. While the adjudicator considers the result, please thank both teams.

The adjudicator will now give the result and feedback.
(After the result:) Thank you to our adjudicator, our timekeeper, and both teams. Please shake hands with your opponents.
{% endfor %}
